Hi,

the OpenPrinting web site (database part) is up and running again! This 
means that one can look up printers and drivers again and both automatic 
(tested on Oneiric) and manual driver download work again. All URLs are 
the same. In addition, openprinting.com is made equivalent to 
openprinting.org.

If you still do not get the pages wait up to one hour for DNS to catch up.

    Till
